## History:
##		- 20260813 JC: Created, replacing the file-based 'x9startup-log' in the Tukzedo boot path.
##			- Logs structured records to the journal instead of a text file under '/tmp', which had to be
##			  moved to '/var/tmp' and back whenever '/tmp' was emptied.
##			- Nesting state moved from '/dev/shm/x9/' to '/run/tkz/' (or the caller's XDG runtime dir), under flock.
##			- Depth is the height of a timestamp stack, which also gives 'TKZ_ELAPSED_MS' on each 'end'.
##			- No world-writable files.
##•••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••••
